+
+For ViFailback, the verification examines the available saved assessment vectors, metric consistency, and completion records associated with the extended reporting boundary.
+
+These checks do not reproduce the original neural fitting procedures or establish independent experimental replication.
+
+The evidence records document source paths, hashes, assessment identities, metric definitions, and the boundaries of the performed verification.
+
+The literature extraction records separately connect external scientific claims to their bibliographic sources and relevant publication passages.
